{"id":"n37264-1-8","stage":4,"title":"난데없이 · 毫无征兆地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37264-1-8-1","ko":"영수 씨, 우리 이제 그만 만나. 헤어지자.","zh":"英洙，我们还是别再见面了吧。分手吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영수","meaning":"英洙","explanation":"영수：英洙","readings":[{"term":"영수","audio":"/audio/778c5ccb861265200bad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨,","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그만","meaning":"就那些，到此为止","explanation":"그만：就那些，到此为止","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나.","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헤어지자.","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"398